;
; How Fireglow files where an episode or book is heard to, in MYRA: its
; show's place and its own place, the position and length in ms (length 0
; not known yet) and the ms listened in all. The digits hold more than
; episode.eve's ranges allow, so a record past them is held.
^ZXFIREGLOW(show:i2, episode:i3) = pos:i9! ^ length:i9! ^ heard:i10!
